OL,3,GNEWSALib Dems' Ed Davey questioned on
OL,4,ABrexit, bin strikes, and small boats on
OL,5,ABBC local radio
OL,6,
OL,7,FLiberal Democrat leader Ed Davey has
OL,8,Ftaken part in a series of quick-fire
OL,9,Finterviews on BBC local radio stations
OL,11,FHis party is preparing to host its
OL,12,Fautumn conference, which takes place in
OL,13,FBrighton from Saturday
OL,15,FThe BBC "local radio round" has been a
OL,16,Fpre-conference tradition for many
OL,17,Fyears. Leaders of the Conservatives,
OL,18,FGreens, Labour and Reform UK have all
OL,19,Fbeen given a similar opportunity -
OL,20,FReform's Richard Tice was first up
OL,21,Fearlier this month
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
