OL,3,GNEWSALib Dems' Ed Davey questioned on
OL,4,ABrexit, bin strikes, and small boats on
OL,5,ABBC local radio
OL,6,
OL,7,FDavey was asked about the local council
OL,8,Fand the pension triple lock on BBC
OL,9,FRadio Shropshire; bin strikes on BBC
OL,10,FRadio WM; and migrant crossings on BBC
OL,11,FRadio Kent;
OL,13,FHe discussed the council's four-day
OL,14,Fweek on BBC Radio Cambridgeshire; the
OL,15,Fdualling of the A1 in Northumberland on
OL,16,FBBC Radio Newcastle; the Lib Dems'
OL,17,Fnational position on BBC Radio
OL,18,FSomerset; and dentistry on BBC Radio
OL,19,FCornwall
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
